  "metadata": {
    "title": "Seymour Duncan: Music Man and P-Bass, 2 volumes, 1 tone",
    "creator": "Pickup Lab; reference: Seymour Duncan",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.seymourduncan.com/images/wiring-diagrams/1MM_1P_2V_1T.pdf",
    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing these wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: P-Bass white/black map to HOT/RETURN; Music Man red/black map to parallel coil starts, green/white to finishes, bare to shield. Bridge ground ends at master-tone casing; no bridge terminal. The 0.05 cap maps to 47 nF. Pots use logical lugs and linear, not audio-taper, controls. Two volumes exceed the master-volume limit, so no estimate."
  },
